  "description": "Shared-secret gate for \"external direct-grant\" internal verify endpoints. A custom Keycloak direct-grant authenticator calls back to a service to verify a credential (OTP, PIN, ...); this package factors out the one security primitive those callback endpoints duplicate: a constant-time, fail-closed, 401-no-body shared-secret header check, configured per method via named options. Each service keeps its own verify DTOs and logic and swaps its bespoke IsAuthorized() for AddExternalDirectGrant(name) + IExternalDirectGrantGate.",
